Process Monitoring

•Any application running on the OS is a process
•To monitor those processes effectively we can use tools which are available in the OS

tools 
 top      Top is an interactive process monitoring tool which is pre installed inmost of the Linux systems
 PS      Ps is short for Process Status. It provides a status report of processes at the time when the command is run
 htop    Htop is a similar tool to top but more colorful  and interactive
 pgrep   Pgrep is used to search for process which are currently running in the system

